{"id":"abe567b9-0e3d-4e9f-a79d-55403d9df133","revision":0,"last_node_id":83,"last_link_id":99,"nodes":[{"id":22,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[260,70],"size":[579.984375,1289.921875],"flags":{"pinned":true},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"工作流说明书","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.7","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["# Z-image 文生图工作流\n\n---\n\n# **🎬 工作流简介：** \n\n本工作流为最基础的文生图工作流，主模型为Z-Image_Turbo，主模型仓库提供有：FP8（小显存专用）、FP16（标准模型）、NSFW（男孩专属），可根据自己需求和配置切换模型！\n\n## **💻小白工具箱:** \n\n- [小白工具箱官方网站](https://github.com/wjluoxiao/XB_ToolBox)  ⬅️ 点击访问 ✅ \n\n## **📂模型传送门:** \n\n- [机制罗的模型总仓库](https://pan.quark.cn/s/6a56ffe475a6)  ⬅️ 点击访问 ✅\n\n## **🌟教程传送门:** \n\n-  [机制罗的保姆级教程](https://space.bilibili.com/302329373)  ⬅️ 点击访问 ✅\n\n---\n\n# 模型位置示意图 & 所需模型名称\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │      └── Z-Image_Base.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 clip/\n│   │      └── qwen_3_4b_fp8_mixed.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 vae/\n│   │      └── ae.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 loras/ \n│          └── Zimage_lora.safetensors\n```\n\n\n---\n## **📝模型说明书:** \n\n**Z-Image_Base:** 2026 年初由阿里巴巴通义万相团队（独立于 Wan 视频团队）推出的重磅超快速文生图模型。是目前平衡美学表现力与部署灵活性的标杆架构。\n\nZ-Image Base (ZIB) 代表了该系列模型的“全血状态”。如果说 Z-Image Turbo 是为了追求极限速度的“快照”，那么 Base 模型 就是为了追求极致画质与物理逻辑的“暗房底片”。适合用来“搞艺术”和“做工程”的话，它的构图稳定性比 Turbo 强了几个维度。\n\n---\n推荐CFG：3.0-5.0\n\n推荐步数：30-50\n\n推荐采样器：euler \n\n推荐调度器：simple\n\n推荐采样偏移：3.0~10.0，按分辨率调整。   \n\n---\n"],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":53,"type":"Label (rgthree)","pos":[390,-50],"size":[320,80],"flags":{"pinned":true,"allow_interaction":false},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"先看说明","properties":{"fontSize":80,"fontFamily":"Arial","fontColor":"#ffffff","textAlign":"left","backgroundColor":"transparent","padding":0,"borderRadius":0,"angle":0,"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.5.2"}},"color":"#fff0","bgcolor":"#fff0"},{"id":52,"type":"Label (rgthree)","pos